==English==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|en|enm|richely}}, from {{inh|en|ang|rīċlīċe}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*rīkīlīkō}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*rīkijalīkô}}; {{surface analysis|en|rich|-ly|pos2=adverbial suffix|id2=adverbial|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
